sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  Browser->>API: subscribeToServer(socket)
  Note right of API: Socket.IO channel created
  loop Monitoring cycle (e.g. every 60s)
    API->>Monitor: runMonitoringCycle()
    Monitor->>TargetSQL: query performance / jobs / dmvs
    Monitor->>ConfigDB: insert history (ServerMemoryHistory, DiskUsageHistory)
    Monitor->>MDW: optionally query aggregated stats
    Monitor->>Monitor: analyze anomalies (jobs failed, disk low)
    alt anomaly detected
      Monitor->>ConfigDB: usp_LogAndCheckSystemAlert(...)
      Monitor->>EmailSvc: sendEmail(...)
      Monitor->>TeamsSvc: sendTeamsAlert(...)
    end
    Monitor->>SocketIO: emit fullStatusUpdate / performanceUpdate
    SocketIO->>Browser: receive update
  end
